1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Once upon a time, there was a maiden with wings of freedom.

2
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,460
A man in love with this maiden thought,

3
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,120
if I could just bind those wings,

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,640
we would never have to be apart even for a moment.

5
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:23,020
But when the man wrapped the maiden's wings in a magical shawl,

6
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:28,000
the wings immediately fell to the ground and the maiden died.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,460
The man did not know that the maiden's wings were the source of her life.

8
00:02:25,437 --> 00:02:30,057
At last, all the characters needed for the story have been assembled.

9
00:02:30,397 --> 00:02:36,037
A prince without the heart to love, a knight who fears death, a villain without resolve,

10
00:02:36,297 --> 00:02:39,237
and a princess who cannot express her love.

11
00:02:40,497 --> 00:02:42,597
Something's still missing, though.

12
00:02:43,417 --> 00:02:45,077
All right, you, go on.

13
00:02:45,317 --> 00:02:48,977
And this time, don't you become interested in people's emotions.

14
00:02:55,437 --> 00:03:02,437
Excuse me, won't you please take this?

15
00:03:03,217 --> 00:03:04,437
It's quite lovely.

16
00:03:05,297 --> 00:03:07,617
The name of this gem is...

17
00:03:07,617 --> 00:03:08,017
Love.

18
00:03:08,317 --> 00:03:08,677
Love.

19
00:03:09,477 --> 00:03:12,017
I would advise you not to let it go.

20
00:03:12,497 --> 00:03:13,437
It suits you.

21
00:03:14,017 --> 00:03:16,997
No, I had no right to be holding on to such a thing.

22
00:03:17,677 --> 00:03:19,637
Someone like me never did.

23
00:03:20,477 --> 00:03:21,117
I see.

24
00:03:23,857 --> 00:03:24,677
Thank you.

25
00:03:25,437 --> 00:03:55,417
Thank you.

26
00:03:55,417 --> 00:03:58,697
Princess Tutu is her.

27
00:03:59,637 --> 00:04:02,157
I don't have any wish to fight you.

28
00:04:05,597 --> 00:04:08,117
It doesn't matter who Princess Tutu is.

29
00:04:09,777 --> 00:04:12,537
I will protect Muto in my own way.

30
00:04:12,537 --> 00:04:19,857
I will be the one guarding him from the clutches of that raven.

31
00:04:22,657 --> 00:04:23,617
Without fear.

32
00:04:23,617 --> 00:04:29,777
I wonder if he really knows now.

33
00:04:29,777 --> 00:04:43,897
You've been sighing all morning.

34
00:04:43,897 --> 00:04:45,037
Poor thing.

35
00:04:45,117 --> 00:04:47,477
The scar of rejection must truly run deep.

36
00:04:47,877 --> 00:04:49,037
You seem happy.

37
00:04:49,337 --> 00:04:49,957
Oh, me?

38
00:04:50,417 --> 00:04:52,457
Thanks for worrying about me.

39
00:04:52,457 --> 00:04:55,017
But it's not about being rejected or anything.

40
00:04:55,017 --> 00:04:55,877
It's okay, Doc.

41
00:04:55,877 --> 00:04:56,917
You don't have to tell us.

42
00:04:56,917 --> 00:04:57,617
We know.

43
00:04:57,617 --> 00:04:58,177
I don't have to tell you.

44
00:04:58,177 --> 00:04:59,977
Anyway, revenge, revenge.

45
00:05:00,177 --> 00:05:01,677
Come on, you've got to do it.

46
00:05:01,817 --> 00:05:02,457
That's right.

47
00:05:02,557 --> 00:05:03,677
You'll do it, won't you?

48
00:05:04,077 --> 00:05:06,257
At any rate, you'll have to get him to notice you.

49
00:05:07,077 --> 00:05:07,637
Yeah.

50
00:05:07,797 --> 00:05:09,077
And that means a present.

51
00:05:09,177 --> 00:05:09,897
Oh, that's good.

52
00:05:10,077 --> 00:05:11,937
Then you'll see how he feels about you.

53
00:05:12,357 --> 00:05:12,917
Really?

54
00:05:12,917 --> 00:05:17,337
Fuck here, too.

55
00:05:17,717 --> 00:05:18,637
Fuck here?

56
00:05:20,417 --> 00:05:23,577
So, giving someone a present will reveal their feelings about you?

57
00:05:23,577 --> 00:05:24,157
Oh, no.

58
00:05:24,297 --> 00:05:25,037
You were listening?

59
00:05:25,177 --> 00:05:25,837
He heard us.

60
00:05:25,997 --> 00:05:27,677
Get a present now and he'll see you.

61
00:05:27,737 --> 00:05:28,537
I'll tell your motive.

62
00:05:29,537 --> 00:05:32,117
When you say present, what kind of thing do you mean?

63
00:05:33,057 --> 00:05:34,197
He's probing us.

64
00:05:34,217 --> 00:05:35,037
What do we do?

65
00:05:35,137 --> 00:05:36,317
How do you think we should answer?

66
00:05:37,697 --> 00:05:39,777
Say, Duck, what if it were you?

67
00:05:39,777 --> 00:05:43,217
Duck would take anything, really.

68
00:05:43,237 --> 00:05:43,717
That's right.

69
00:05:43,777 --> 00:05:45,597
She'd take anything, anything she could get.

70
00:05:45,617 --> 00:05:47,117
As long as it's given with love.

71
00:05:47,137 --> 00:05:48,817
Gems or bars of solid gold.

72
00:05:49,357 --> 00:05:49,757
Love?

73
00:05:50,237 --> 00:05:51,577
There needs to be love?

74
00:05:51,717 --> 00:05:56,157
Mr. Muto, I held a special class yesterday on being in love.

75
00:05:56,817 --> 00:05:59,777
Perhaps I need to hold a special class on love itself.

76
00:06:00,137 --> 00:06:01,837
Are you saying that there's a difference?

77
00:06:01,917 --> 00:06:03,797
Of course there is.

78
00:06:03,797 --> 00:06:07,797
If you do not grasp that, you will not be able to get married.

79
00:06:09,777 --> 00:06:17,317
Would you care to sit in as well, Mr. Fakir?

80
00:06:17,377 --> 00:06:18,117
No, thank you.

81
00:06:18,577 --> 00:06:20,477
Then, Mr. Muto, let us go.

82
00:06:21,257 --> 00:06:27,437
Gifts are perfectly fine, but such things as anti-flea collars can be rude, so discretion is necessary.

83
00:06:30,017 --> 00:06:32,517
Does he know after all?

84
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:41,437
Fakir!

85
00:06:41,597 --> 00:06:42,697
I want to ask you something.

86
00:06:43,497 --> 00:06:44,117
Follow me.

87
00:06:47,617 --> 00:06:49,117
What'd you want to ask me?

88
00:06:49,217 --> 00:06:50,537
Princess Tutu.

89
00:06:50,717 --> 00:06:51,477
Oh, come on!

90
00:06:52,417 --> 00:06:53,777
You are, aren't you?

91
00:06:53,777 --> 00:06:57,457
I'm surprised, to be honest.

92
00:06:57,997 --> 00:07:00,357
Of all the people, I never expected it was you.

93
00:07:00,997 --> 00:07:02,737
I want to ask you something, too.

94
00:07:03,257 --> 00:07:06,437
Just like me, you're fighting to protect Muto, aren't you?

95
00:07:06,917 --> 00:07:09,737
Then why do you keep trying to shatter his heart all the time?

96
00:07:10,277 --> 00:07:10,717
Why?

97
00:07:11,237 --> 00:07:14,797
That is something that has no bearing on the present situation, understand?

98
00:07:14,797 --> 00:07:17,257
The tale can no longer be halted.

99
00:07:17,917 --> 00:07:18,877
The tale?

100
00:07:19,177 --> 00:07:21,577
If you wish to restore his heart, then go ahead.

101
00:07:22,097 --> 00:07:26,337
No matter what the outcome of your little heroics, I will protect Muto.

102
00:07:27,057 --> 00:07:29,037
Then why don't we work together?

103
00:07:29,297 --> 00:07:30,237
And that way...

104
00:07:30,237 --> 00:07:31,057
No, thank you.

105
00:07:31,757 --> 00:07:32,837
But why not?

106
00:07:32,957 --> 00:07:35,037
To put it simply, I don't trust you.

107
00:07:35,037 --> 00:07:54,717
Muto, if you regain any more of your heart, you'll grow distant from me.

108
00:07:54,797 --> 00:07:55,437
I know it.

109
00:07:56,717 --> 00:07:58,977
I am a crow, your enemy.

110
00:08:00,137 --> 00:08:02,497
Even though I love you so much.

111
00:08:02,497 --> 00:08:09,357
I wish I could have stayed Rue forever, free of Krayi's memories.

112
00:08:10,217 --> 00:08:11,497
But now...

113
00:08:13,397 --> 00:08:15,577
Would anyone like some gems?

114
00:08:16,397 --> 00:08:20,377
Would anyone like a gem to give your loved one as a gift?

115
00:08:21,017 --> 00:08:21,497
Welcome.

116
00:08:22,137 --> 00:08:22,497
Aren't you...

117
00:08:23,497 --> 00:08:25,017
It's been a while, Rue.

118
00:08:25,717 --> 00:08:26,657
As a gift?

119
00:08:27,277 --> 00:08:29,417
Has this one bought your fancy?

120
00:08:29,417 --> 00:08:33,217
The name of this gem here is love.

121
00:08:33,897 --> 00:08:34,837
It's love?

122
00:08:35,517 --> 00:08:37,397
I think it's beautiful.

123
00:08:37,757 --> 00:08:41,357
Since you seem to like it so much, I shall give it to you.

124
00:08:41,897 --> 00:08:42,957
Are you sure?

125
00:08:43,237 --> 00:08:43,897
I am.

126
00:08:44,217 --> 00:08:46,977
Please take this as I have no use for it.

127
00:08:47,057 --> 00:08:48,977
Why don't you accept it, Muto?

128
00:08:48,977 --> 00:08:54,997
And yet, though this gem is strong, it is easily scarred.

129
00:08:55,437 --> 00:08:57,757
Though beautiful, it is easily tarnished.

130
00:08:58,297 --> 00:09:01,157
If fought over, it may prove deadly.

131
00:09:01,977 --> 00:09:04,357
Please use care in handling it.

132
00:09:09,317 --> 00:09:11,577
You really like it that much?

133
00:09:11,577 --> 00:09:15,537
So, you're going to give it to me, aren't you?

134
00:09:17,737 --> 00:09:18,337
Rue.

135
00:09:20,937 --> 00:09:21,537
Sorry.

136
00:09:22,037 --> 00:09:22,397
This is...

137
00:09:25,977 --> 00:09:29,577
I was just kidding.

138
00:09:30,637 --> 00:09:31,377
I see.

139
00:09:31,977 --> 00:09:33,837
I wonder who the lucky girl is.

140
00:09:33,957 --> 00:09:34,397
That's not...

141
00:09:34,397 --> 00:09:36,797
Could I see it for a second?

142
00:09:37,177 --> 00:09:37,537
Sure.

143
00:09:37,537 --> 00:09:41,497
It's beautiful, but it seems there's something important missing.

144
00:09:41,977 --> 00:09:42,977
I wonder what...

145
00:09:42,977 --> 00:09:43,217
What?

146
00:09:43,617 --> 00:09:44,097
Really?

147
00:09:44,357 --> 00:09:44,717
Shh!

148
00:09:47,357 --> 00:09:48,357
I'm sorry.

149
00:09:48,737 --> 00:09:50,277
I know it's precious to you.

150
00:09:51,337 --> 00:09:54,017
Say, would you let me borrow it for tonight?

151
00:09:54,277 --> 00:09:56,557
I'll fix it up and make it even prettier,

152
00:09:56,917 --> 00:10:00,277
so that you can secure the heart of the one you love.

153
00:10:00,797 --> 00:10:01,317
Okay.

154
00:10:01,317 --> 00:10:04,377
The results ought to please you.

155
00:10:04,377 --> 00:10:27,917
Mewtwo, I will not let anyone else have you.

156
00:10:27,917 --> 00:10:30,797
I'll never hand you over.

157
00:10:31,657 --> 00:10:33,197
Very good, very good.

158
00:10:33,377 --> 00:10:36,277
Another necessary component of the tale has been added.

159
00:10:36,597 --> 00:10:38,497
Love filled with hatred.

160
00:10:39,937 --> 00:10:42,557
This is an interesting device, yes?

161
00:10:42,557 --> 00:10:53,117
Fakir found out.

162
00:10:53,757 --> 00:10:55,337
But it's kind of strange.

163
00:10:55,597 --> 00:10:57,597
I actually feel relieved now.

164
00:10:58,497 --> 00:11:00,637
To put it simply, I don't trust you.

165
00:11:00,637 --> 00:11:03,837
Fakir's always thinking by himself.

166
00:11:04,357 --> 00:11:05,697
Deciding by himself.

167
00:11:06,057 --> 00:11:07,177
Fighting by himself.

168
00:11:07,917 --> 00:11:08,317
Even...

169
00:11:08,317 --> 00:11:10,977
Even crying by himself.

170
00:11:11,597 --> 00:11:13,477
He won't show me his true face.

171
00:11:17,977 --> 00:11:21,617
It was warm there, in Fakir's arms.

172
00:11:21,617 --> 00:11:26,037
I bet that's the real Fakir.

173
00:11:32,357 --> 00:11:32,917
Fakir.

174
00:11:33,297 --> 00:11:34,077
Yes, what?

175
00:11:34,497 --> 00:11:36,697
I'm thinking of giving a gift to Tutu.

176
00:11:37,197 --> 00:11:37,917
That's so.

177
00:11:38,537 --> 00:11:39,357
You're not angry?

178
00:11:39,837 --> 00:11:40,837
Do as you wish.

179
00:11:41,957 --> 00:11:44,877
Don't turn your sword against Tutu again.

180
00:11:45,117 --> 00:11:45,897
Please, Fakir.

181
00:11:46,017 --> 00:11:47,617
I want you to promise me...

182
00:11:47,617 --> 00:11:49,617
I can't make that promise.

183
00:11:49,617 --> 00:12:01,637
Now, please do not stoop!

184
00:12:01,957 --> 00:12:02,617
Yes, sir!

185
00:12:03,397 --> 00:12:04,517
Thanks for waiting.

186
00:12:05,517 --> 00:12:06,637
What do you think?

187
00:12:07,777 --> 00:12:08,957
It's wonderful.

188
00:12:10,497 --> 00:12:11,617
Isn't it, though?

189
00:12:12,237 --> 00:12:14,257
If you give this to the one you love,

190
00:12:14,317 --> 00:12:16,417
you'll be able to secure her heart now.

191
00:12:16,797 --> 00:12:17,937
And for all time.

192
00:12:17,937 --> 00:12:20,237
Thank you, Rue.

193
00:12:35,657 --> 00:12:37,477
I wish I could go home once

194
00:12:37,477 --> 00:12:39,017
without having to stay after.

195
00:12:39,477 --> 00:12:39,937
But, Mewtwo!

196
00:12:39,937 --> 00:12:40,497
Mewtwo!

197
00:12:43,277 --> 00:12:43,817
Mewtwo!

198
00:12:47,817 --> 00:12:51,017
What was that?

199
00:12:51,237 --> 00:12:52,417
I don't know what happened,

200
00:12:52,537 --> 00:12:53,997
but I better go after him.

201
00:12:54,417 --> 00:12:55,877
Protecting the prince is also

202
00:12:55,877 --> 00:12:57,657
Princess Tutu's...

203
00:12:57,657 --> 00:12:58,937
Thunder?

204
00:12:58,937 --> 00:13:05,137
Mewtwo didn't have an umbrella, did he?

205
00:13:05,777 --> 00:13:06,817
Where did he go?

206
00:13:12,817 --> 00:13:13,897
Princess Tutu.

207
00:13:15,777 --> 00:13:17,477
I wonder where she is.

208
00:13:17,477 --> 00:13:46,737
I wonder where he went.

209
00:13:46,737 --> 00:13:50,977
Would anyone like some gems?

210
00:13:51,217 --> 00:13:51,777
Miss Edo!

211
00:13:52,737 --> 00:13:53,837
Hi, Miss Edo!

212
00:13:54,057 --> 00:13:56,097
It's been a while, hasn't it?

213
00:13:56,217 --> 00:13:57,577
Now that you mention it,

214
00:13:57,597 --> 00:13:58,737
it has been a while.

215
00:14:00,997 --> 00:14:02,297
Anyway, Miss Edo,

216
00:14:02,457 --> 00:14:03,937
have you seen Mewtwo around?

217
00:14:04,157 --> 00:14:05,377
If you want Mewtwo,

218
00:14:05,537 --> 00:14:06,777
he's searching for the one

219
00:14:06,777 --> 00:14:07,977
to give his gift to.

220
00:14:08,077 --> 00:14:08,297
Huh?

221
00:14:08,957 --> 00:14:09,857
Mewtwo's gift?

222
00:14:09,857 --> 00:14:12,097
So giving someone a present

223
00:14:12,097 --> 00:14:13,957
will reveal their feelings about you?

224
00:14:14,677 --> 00:14:16,197
What do you think of me?

225
00:14:17,317 --> 00:14:18,737
I want to know.

226
00:14:19,377 --> 00:14:19,857
I...

227
00:14:19,857 --> 00:14:20,857
I...

228
00:14:20,857 --> 00:14:25,897
The one to give his gift to?

229
00:14:26,857 --> 00:14:27,937
Oh, I know.

230
00:14:28,037 --> 00:14:28,817
It's Roo, right?

231
00:14:29,077 --> 00:14:30,537
With his feelings coming back,

232
00:14:30,597 --> 00:14:31,757
he probably wants to know

233
00:14:31,757 --> 00:14:33,097
how Roo feels and stuff.

234
00:14:33,557 --> 00:14:33,877
Mm-hmm.

235
00:14:34,317 --> 00:14:34,997
That's it.

236
00:14:35,417 --> 00:14:35,857
But...

237
00:14:35,857 --> 00:14:38,777
If the gift was for Tutu...

238
00:14:38,777 --> 00:14:40,317
Well, even if that were true,

239
00:14:40,397 --> 00:14:41,477
it's not for me as Duck,

240
00:14:41,537 --> 00:14:42,257
but for Tutu,

241
00:14:42,357 --> 00:14:44,057
so it really has nothing to do with me.

242
00:14:44,837 --> 00:14:46,357
Nothing to do with me.

243
00:14:48,217 --> 00:14:49,257
Thank you, Miss Edo!

244
00:14:51,197 --> 00:14:51,637
Hmm.

245
00:14:53,117 --> 00:14:54,697
Maybe he'll be looking somewhere

246
00:14:54,697 --> 00:14:55,737
that he met Tutu.

247
00:14:55,737 --> 00:15:18,657
Mewtwo!

248
00:15:18,657 --> 00:15:22,157
Mewtwo, where are you?

249
00:15:24,377 --> 00:15:25,377
Tutu...

250
00:15:25,377 --> 00:15:27,617
Can I not see you,

251
00:15:28,857 --> 00:15:29,997
Princess Tutu?

252
00:15:37,997 --> 00:15:38,997
Tutu...

253
00:15:38,997 --> 00:15:40,997
Mewtwo!

254
00:15:48,997 --> 00:15:49,937
Is that Duck?

255
00:15:51,537 --> 00:15:52,657
Mewtwo...

256
00:15:52,657 --> 00:15:55,977
Why have you come here?

257
00:15:56,197 --> 00:15:58,377
Oh, it seemed like it might rain,

258
00:15:58,457 --> 00:16:00,117
and I thought you might not have an umbrella,

259
00:16:00,417 --> 00:16:00,897
so I...

260
00:16:01,897 --> 00:16:03,277
Are you waiting for someone?

261
00:16:03,737 --> 00:16:04,117
Yes.

262
00:16:04,737 --> 00:16:05,957
For Princess Tutu.

263
00:16:06,377 --> 00:16:06,737
Huh?

264
00:16:07,417 --> 00:16:08,517
Tell me, Duck,

265
00:16:08,657 --> 00:16:10,057
do you know about Tutu?

266
00:16:10,277 --> 00:16:10,537
What?

267
00:16:10,537 --> 00:16:13,157
Oh, no, I don't, but...

268
00:16:13,157 --> 00:16:13,497
Oh.

269
00:16:15,037 --> 00:16:15,777
Um...

270
00:16:15,777 --> 00:16:17,217
Please use this, okay?

271
00:16:17,477 --> 00:16:18,357
Oh, thank you.

272
00:16:18,677 --> 00:16:19,837
I hope you see her.

273
00:16:20,257 --> 00:16:20,657
Yes.

274
00:16:21,417 --> 00:16:21,757
Bye.

275
00:16:21,757 --> 00:16:31,537
The one Mewtwo wants to see isn't me,

276
00:16:31,637 --> 00:16:33,377
it's Princess Tutu, but...

277
00:16:33,377 --> 00:16:35,557
Oh, my, that's dangerous.

278
00:16:35,677 --> 00:16:37,377
That thought is truly dangerous.

279
00:16:37,517 --> 00:16:40,097
Are you sure about this, Princess Tutu?

280
00:16:40,097 --> 00:16:40,817
Can't I see her?

281
00:16:40,817 --> 00:16:45,297
No, I don't see her.

282
00:16:45,297 --> 00:17:09,817
My prince?

283
00:17:09,817 --> 00:17:13,617
Is my prince searching for somebody?

284
00:17:15,297 --> 00:17:20,297
Tutu.

285
00:17:20,297 --> 00:17:22,297
My prince.

286
00:17:22,297 --> 00:17:23,297
Finally.

287
00:17:23,297 --> 00:17:26,297
I got a chance to see you.

288
00:17:26,297 --> 00:17:27,297
It's lovely.

289
00:17:27,297 --> 00:17:29,297
I'd like for you to accept this.

290
00:17:29,297 --> 00:17:32,297
If that is what my prince wishes.

291
00:17:32,297 --> 00:17:34,297
I'll put it on you.

292
00:17:34,297 --> 00:17:36,297
Alright.

293
00:17:42,297 --> 00:17:44,297
Oh, thank you.

294
00:17:44,297 --> 00:17:45,297
That's strange.

295
00:17:45,297 --> 00:17:46,297
What is?

296
00:17:46,297 --> 00:17:50,297
They said if you give someone a gift, you'll know how they feel.

297
00:17:50,297 --> 00:17:52,297
But I still don't know how you feel.

298
00:17:52,297 --> 00:17:55,297
I don't know what it is you think of me.

299
00:17:55,297 --> 00:17:56,297
That...

300
00:17:56,297 --> 00:17:57,297
Although...

301
00:17:57,297 --> 00:17:58,297
Huh?

302
00:17:58,297 --> 00:17:59,297
It made you happy.

303
00:17:59,297 --> 00:18:01,297
So I think that's okay too.

304
00:18:01,297 --> 00:18:02,297
My prince.

305
00:18:02,297 --> 00:18:03,297
What?

306
00:18:03,297 --> 00:18:04,297
This is...

307
00:18:04,297 --> 00:18:05,297
A heart shard.

308
00:18:05,297 --> 00:18:06,297
Come on out.

309
00:18:06,297 --> 00:18:07,297
What feeling are you supposed to be?

310
00:18:07,297 --> 00:18:08,297
I am the feeling of love.

311
00:18:08,297 --> 00:18:09,297
Oh, the feeling of love.

312
00:18:09,297 --> 00:18:10,297
You are?

313
00:18:10,297 --> 00:18:11,297
You don't have to wander any longer.

314
00:18:11,297 --> 00:18:13,297
The place for you to return to is here.

315
00:18:13,297 --> 00:18:14,297
I'm so glad.

316
00:18:14,297 --> 00:18:19,297
Inside that ornament it was dark and those terrifying crows.

317
00:18:19,297 --> 00:18:20,297
Ah!

318
00:18:20,297 --> 00:18:21,297
Ah!

319
00:18:21,297 --> 00:18:22,297
Ah!

320
00:18:22,297 --> 00:18:23,297
Ah!

321
00:18:23,297 --> 00:18:24,297
Ah!

322
00:18:24,297 --> 00:18:25,297
Ah!

323
00:18:25,297 --> 00:18:26,297
Ah!

324
00:18:26,297 --> 00:18:27,297
Ah!

325
00:18:27,297 --> 00:18:28,297
Ah!

326
00:18:28,297 --> 00:18:29,297
Ah!

327
00:18:29,297 --> 00:18:30,297
Ay!

328
00:18:30,297 --> 00:18:31,297
Ah!

329
00:18:31,297 --> 00:18:32,297
Ah!

330
00:18:32,297 --> 00:18:33,297
Ahh.

331
00:18:33,297 --> 00:18:34,297
Ahh!

332
00:18:34,297 --> 00:18:35,297
Ah!

333
00:18:35,297 --> 00:18:36,297
Ahh.

334
00:18:36,297 --> 00:18:38,297
Oh!

335
00:18:38,297 --> 00:18:39,297
Jess!

336
00:18:39,297 --> 00:18:39,857
T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T-T…

337
00:18:39,857 --> 00:19:03,777
The feeling of love, is it?

338
00:19:04,297 --> 00:19:06,797
I was hoping to dispatch Tutu with the gem,

339
00:19:06,917 --> 00:19:08,477
but look what turned up.

340
00:19:08,477 --> 00:19:10,197
And now I know your identity.

341
00:19:12,957 --> 00:19:14,517
Grahi, what are you doing?

342
00:19:19,357 --> 00:19:19,957
What?

343
00:19:20,837 --> 00:19:21,477
Bakir!

344
00:19:22,417 --> 00:19:23,957
Back off, you raven.

345
00:19:24,537 --> 00:19:26,257
Oh my, that's dangerous.

346
00:19:26,477 --> 00:19:28,517
That action is truly dangerous.

347
00:19:29,757 --> 00:19:31,697
You may be the Knight Reborn,

348
00:19:31,797 --> 00:19:33,237
but you're still just a human.

349
00:19:33,537 --> 00:19:35,557
Are you sure of the course you're taking?

350
00:19:35,557 --> 00:19:39,777
Then again, the princess is only a mere dark, isn't she?

351
00:19:40,097 --> 00:19:43,237
And the prince is really nothing but a story.

352
00:19:43,977 --> 00:19:46,877
It's dangerous not knowing your place in the world.

353
00:19:47,537 --> 00:19:49,537
Oh, yes, and who might I ask?

354
00:19:49,597 --> 00:19:51,097
Are you Princess Grahi?

355
00:19:51,277 --> 00:19:52,277
Are you really the villain?

356
00:19:52,657 --> 00:19:54,217
Are you really the raven?

357
00:19:54,217 --> 00:19:56,677
How truly dangerous.

358
00:19:56,897 --> 00:19:59,457
Don't you know the danger you put yourself in,

359
00:19:59,537 --> 00:20:01,377
not knowing your place?

360
00:20:03,697 --> 00:20:05,497
Stay away from Mewtwo.

361
00:20:05,817 --> 00:20:07,317
Begone, you ugly crow!

362
00:20:07,317 --> 00:20:07,997
No!

363
00:20:19,157 --> 00:20:19,197
Craigie!

364
00:20:21,197 --> 00:20:21,737
Ah!

365
00:20:25,737 --> 00:20:26,317
Ah!

366
00:20:27,797 --> 00:20:28,537
Ah!

367
00:20:29,537 --> 00:20:30,537
Vakir!

368
00:20:32,537 --> 00:20:34,537
You see, what did I just say, hmm?

369
00:20:34,537 --> 00:20:39,537
If you're the knight, you have to conquer any fears you have and defeat the villain.

370
00:20:39,537 --> 00:20:43,537
If you're the villain, you have to eliminate the princess without any show of mercy.

371
00:20:43,537 --> 00:20:48,537
If you're the princess, you have to save the prince by the power of your love.

372
00:20:48,537 --> 00:20:51,537
If you're the prince, you have to use your wisdom and courage.

373
00:20:51,537 --> 00:20:53,537
Oh, I knew something was missing.

374
00:20:54,537 --> 00:20:56,537
Yes, I am Princess Krehi.

375
00:20:56,537 --> 00:20:59,537
Whatever I want, I will take by force.

376
00:21:00,537 --> 00:21:02,537
What are you intending to do?

377
00:21:02,537 --> 00:21:03,537
Krehi!

378
00:21:09,537 --> 00:21:11,537
How do you like it, Princess Tutu?

379
00:21:11,537 --> 00:21:13,537
Being bound by the prince's feelings?

380
00:21:13,537 --> 00:21:14,537
What?

381
00:21:14,537 --> 00:21:15,537
Hurts, yes.

382
00:21:15,537 --> 00:21:18,537
Well, that only shows how strongly he feels for you.

383
00:21:20,537 --> 00:21:21,537
How shameful.

384
00:21:23,537 --> 00:21:26,537
No, Krehi!

385
00:21:30,537 --> 00:21:31,537
Stop!

386
00:21:31,537 --> 00:21:33,537
You love the prince, right?

387
00:21:38,537 --> 00:21:39,537
But why?

388
00:21:41,537 --> 00:21:43,537
Why would you do something so horrible?

389
00:21:43,537 --> 00:21:44,537
Oh, dear.

390
00:21:44,537 --> 00:21:49,537
The enemy now knows your identity and you've lost the prince.

391
00:21:49,537 --> 00:21:50,537
How delightful.

392
00:21:50,537 --> 00:21:51,537
How terrible.

393
00:21:51,537 --> 00:21:52,537
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

394
00:21:52,537 --> 00:21:53,537
How terrible!

395
00:21:53,537 --> 00:21:55,537
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

396
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:29,119
Time when I'd lost this necklace, you held on to it for me, remember, Fakir?

397
00:23:29,559 --> 00:23:30,819
Would you hold on to it again?

398
00:23:31,179 --> 00:23:32,679
It can't be that dull.

399
00:23:32,699 --> 00:23:35,179
Have you regressed to the doll you used to be?

400
00:23:35,279 --> 00:23:37,219
Because I withdrew that piece of your heart.

401
00:23:37,379 --> 00:23:40,079
But this same knight was torn in two by the claws of the raven,

402
00:23:40,339 --> 00:23:43,139
without the knight even landing a single blow with his sword.

403
00:23:43,519 --> 00:23:46,119
A useless wretch who could only talk of protection.

404
00:23:46,219 --> 00:23:48,099
Please, stop this malevolence now!

405
00:23:48,099 --> 00:23:52,639
All you children who love stories, come gather round!

406
00:23:55,279 --> 00:23:56,099
Fakir.

